test "rank349: Celery root warning checks effective uid"
  lang python
  expect VYQL-AUTH-015
  expect_review code.EffectiveUidRootCheckBypass
  code
  ```
  import os
  import warnings

  class Worker(object):
      def run(self):
          if getattr(os, "geteuid", None) and os.geteuid() == 0:
              warnings.warn(
                  "Running celeryd with superuser privileges is not encouraged!")
  ```

test "rank349: Celery root warning checks real uid"
  lang python
  reject VYQL-AUTH-015
  reject_review code.EffectiveUidRootCheckBypass
  code
  ```
  import os
  import warnings

  class Worker(object):
      def run(self):
          if getattr(os, "getuid", None) and os.getuid() == 0:
              warnings.warn(
                  "Running celeryd with superuser privileges is discouraged!")
  ```
